  <prompt>Generalize ComposeDocumentRenderer.SynthesizeDocument so it renders a fresh docx from the canonical document model for ANY source (imported/PDF-ready canonical model), not only born-in-editor blocks. This makes render-from-model the single save-path renderer wired by task 010, reusing the deterministic R4.5 NumberingComputationEngine for numbering.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Deep expertise in OOXML authoring via DocumentFormat.OpenXml 3.5.1, the ComposeContentModel/projection, and the R4.5 NumberingComputationEngine. Follow ADRs strictly.</role>
  <goal>SynthesizeDocument (ComposeDocumentRenderer.cs:102) accepts the canonical document model (the generalized ComposeContentModel that both born-in-editor and imported sources project into) and emits a faithful docx — including deterministic numbering via NumberingComputationEngine — with no dependence on inherited/anchored XML; an empty edit set still yields a faithful render of the current model.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>spec FR-03: generalize the editor projection into the single canonical hub — every source becomes the model, the editor edits the model, save renders the model out. SynthesizeDocument already renders born-in-editor blocks (author-not-patch); this task widens its input contract to the canonical model so task 010's Imported routing has a renderer to call. Numbering must reuse the R4.5 NumberingComputationEngine (deterministic, numId-scoped). Task 020 (Phase 2) further generalizes the model itself; this task focuses on the renderer input.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Compose/ComposeDocumentRenderer.cs:102 — SynthesizeDocument (generalize input to canonical model); :142 AppendSection (author-not-patch precedent to extend).</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Compose/ComposeDocxProjectionBuilder.cs:1357 — NumberingComputationEngine (deterministic, numId-scoped; reuse for numbering).</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Compose/ComposeService.cs:714 — the Imported branch (task 010) that calls this renderer.</file>
    </relevant-files>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="001" status="pending">ADR-049 Path-B amendment (render-on-save) merged with/before this code.</dependency>
      <dependency task="020" status="pending">Canonical document model hub + docx→canonical-model projection in place; this task generalizes SynthesizeDocument to render that widened model out. (RE-SEQUENCED 2026-08-05: was dep 010 — the renderer generalization pairs with the model build and precedes the cutover.)</dependency>
    </dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
