    <constraint source="ADR-013">Scope: NO AI-internal types in Services/Compose; if any AI capability is needed, consume Services/Ai/PublicContracts/ seams only — no fork.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Scope: numbering MUST reuse the existing NumberingComputationEngine (R4.5, deterministic numId-scoped) — do not author a parallel numbering path (§11 reuse).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Scope (Placement Justification, root §10): modify/extend of existing Services/Compose renderer — cite .claude/constraints/bff-extensions.md in the PR, verify publish size ≤60 MB (absolute + delta vs task-003 baseline), verify no new HIGH CVE, run /conflict-check before the PR. NEVER delete docxBridge.ts.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-039">Scope: engine frozen — no new AI dispatch endpoint.</constraint>
  </constraints>

