  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Given a canonical model from an imported source, when SynthesizeDocument runs, then it emits a faithful docx with no dependence on inherited/anchored XML.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given numbered content, when rendered, then numbering labels are computed via NumberingComputationEngine and match Word for the corpus numbering exemplars (R4.5 golden labels).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given an empty edit set, when SynthesizeDocument runs, then it produces a faithful render of the current model (not an error / not a no-op patch).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative: no Microsoft.Graph or AI-internal type is introduced into Services/Compose; no parallel numbering path is created.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Publish size ≤60 MB with absolute + delta reported; no new HIGH CVE; BFF builds green.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

